post-it: Mouse glitches
cause: Fragmented hard drive
symptoms:
	Slow computer
checks:
	yes: Windows starts
	yes: Windows stays up after the desktop appears
	no: Bluescreen after the desktop appears
	no: Freezes with a buzz after the desktop appears
	yes: Windows takes long to start
		shows: the splash screen lasts three times as long
	yes: Folders take seconds to open
		shows: 2 s each
	yes: Desktop icons open
	no: CD tray opens and closes by itself
	no: Unknown program in StartUp
software steps:
	Run Disk Defragmenter
	Leave it on overnight
notes:
	WILL TAKE UNTIL EVENING NEXT DAY
